    "statement": "iPad Pro 11 (2020) no touch across multiple screens is often a faulty capacitor on PP1V5V0_TOUCH_LDO near the BCM15957 touch controller.",
    "evidence": "Problem description.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   },
   {
    "statement": "PP1V5V0_TOUCH_LDO reads about 0.450–0.500 in diode mode and about 1.5 V powered; near zero indicates the shorted/leaky cap.",
    "evidence": "Diagnostic steps.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   }
  ],
  "procedure": [
   "Inspect near BCM15957.",
   "Diode-check and measure PP1V5V0_TOUCH_LDO.",
   "Inject ~1 V; find the warm cap; replace from donor."
